OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA settled
OL,6,Fstart to Monday night. Winds will
OL,7,Fgradually freshen overnight with cloud
OL,8,Fand heavy rain arriving after
OL,9,Fmidnight. Some very heavy rain
OL,10,Fpossible towards dawn. Minimum
OL,11,FTemperature 5C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FWet and windy start to
OL,14,FTuesday. Drier and brighter by the
OL,15,Fafternoon with further strong and
OL,16,Fgusty winds and a chance of gales.
OL,17,FVery or exceptionally mild by the
OL,18,Fafternoon. Maximum Temperature 15C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
