OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with blustery showers.
OL,7,FWinds easing for Thursday with bright
OL,8,For sunny spells. Overnight stronger
OL,9,Fwinds will ease, with rain clearing by
OL,10,FFriday afternoon. Temperatures mostly
OL,11,Fabove normal.
